#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_tender.purchase_order_form_inherit_tender
msgid ""
"Create a call for tender by adding alternative requests for quotation to "
"different vendors.                                 Make your choice by "
"selecting the best combination of lead time, OTD and/or total amount."
"                                 By comparing product lines you can also "
"decide to order some products from one vendor and others from another "
"vendor."
msgstr ""
"異なる仕入先へ代替見積依頼を追加して、入札募集を作成します。                                "
"リードタイム、納期遵守率(OTD)及び／または総額の最適な組み合わせからお選び下さい。"
"                                 "
"プロダクト明細を比較することで、ある仕入先にあるプロダクトをオーダし、別の仕入先に別のプロダクトを注文する決定をすることもできます。"

